    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="74.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 74.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne þone ceap nelle fore gesellan, þonne mot hine se hlaford gefreogean. Gieldan siððan his mægas þone wer, gif he mægburg hæbbe freo. Gif he næbbe, heden his þa gefan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If, however, he does not wish to pay this amount for him, then the lord may free him. His kinsmen must afterwards pay the wer [for the slain man], if he has free kin. If he does not, then his enemies may take possession of him.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If, however, the lord will not pay this price for him, he must liberate him; afterwards his kinsmen must pay the wergeld, if he has a free kindred; if he has not [a free kindred], then his enemies may deal with him.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne þone ceap nylle foregesellan, þonne mot hine se hlaford gefreogean; gildon siððan his magas þone wer; gif he mægburh hæbbe freo; gif he næbbe, heden his ðonne ða gefan.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
